# Pages & Routes

**Strict subfolder order:** `page.tsx` → `layout.tsx` → `hooks/` → `components/` → `schemas/` → `utils/`

- Kit route group: `(erp)` stub shell. Production also uses `(auth)` and `(lms)`.
- Do **not** put production auth guards in kit unless asked — document them for handoff.
- Data flow: `page` → `hooks` → `*Thunks` → `*Api`. Never call `*Api` from pages.
- Page components: `export default function XxxPage()`.
- Don't fetch in shared/ui components — fetch in pages/hooks, pass props down.
- Kit-only mock APIs live under `src/app/api/v1/...` — do not ship those into frontend-v2.
